A fly genus including experimental models for cell competition and genetic conflict.

= Drosophila persimilis
{parent=Drosophila}
{c}

= Drosophila simulans
{parent=Drosophila}
{c}

A fly species with experimentally characterized sex-ratio drive and suppressor systems.

= Temnothorax albipennis
{parent=Insect}
{c}

The ant used in the cited test separating task specialization from individual task efficiency.

= Honeybee
{parent=Insect}

Apis mellifera in the cited studies of worker task development and <worker policing>.

= Andrena nigroaenea
{parent=Insect}
{c}

A solitary bee studied as the pollinator targeted by sexual deception in <Ophrys sphegodes>.

